    many to read a call. Both are gone; `WORK_SHELL`, `syncWork` and the `.st-work` CSS were deleted
    rather than left behind a flag.
    It did NOT need a list of thinking runs in the message model - deriving them from at/rat at render
    time is enough, and storing a second copy of the reasoning is the wrong shape (see LESSONS.md).

